msgid "Pending removal in future versions"
msgstr "将来のバージョンで削除予定"

msgid ""
"The following APIs are deprecated and will be removed, although there is "
"currently no date scheduled for their removal."
msgstr ""
"以下の API は非推奨となり、削除される予定ですが、現時点では削除時期は決まって"
"いません。"

msgid ":c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_FINALIZE`: Unneeded since Python 3.8."
msgstr ":c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_FINALIZE`：Python 3.8 以降では不要です。"

msgid ":c:func:`PyErr_Fetch`: Use :c:func:`PyErr_GetRaisedException` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`PyErr_Fetch`：代わりに :c:func:`PyErr_GetRaisedException` を使ってく"
"ださい。"

msgid ""
":c:func:`PyErr_NormalizeException`: Use :c:func:`PyErr_GetRaisedException` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`PyErr_NormalizeException`：代わりに :c:func:"
"`PyErr_GetRaisedException` を使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:func:`PyErr_Restore`: Use :c:func:`PyErr_SetRaisedException` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`PyErr_Restore`：代わりに :c:func:`PyErr_SetRaisedException` を使って"
"ください。"

msgid ""
":c:func:`PyModule_GetFilename`: Use :c:func:`PyModule_GetFilenameObject` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`PyModule_GetFilename`：代わりに :c:func:"
"`PyModule_GetFilenameObject` を使ってください。"

msgid ":c:func:`PyOS_AfterFork`: Use :c:func:`PyOS_AfterFork_Child` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`PyOS_AfterFork`：代わりに :c:func:`PyOS_AfterFork_Child` を使ってく"
"ださい。"

msgid ""
":c:func:`PySlice_GetIndicesEx`: Use :c:func:`PySlice_Unpack` and :c:func:"
"`PySlice_AdjustIndices` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`PySlice_GetIndicesEx`：代わりに :c:func:`PySlice_Unpack` と :c:func:"
"`PySlice_AdjustIndices` を使ってください。"

msgid ":c:func:`PyUnicode_READY`: Unneeded since Python 3.12"
msgstr ":c:func:`PyUnicode_READY`：Python 3.12 以降では不要です。"

msgid ":c:func:`!PyErr_Display`: Use :c:func:`PyErr_DisplayException` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PyErr_Display`：代わりに :c:func:`PyErr_DisplayException` を使って"
"ください。"

msgid ""
":c:func:`!_PyErr_ChainExceptions`: Use :c:func:`!_PyErr_ChainExceptions1` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!_PyErr_ChainExceptions`：代わりに :c:func:`!"
"_PyErr_ChainExceptions1` を使ってください。"

msgid ""
":c:member:`!PyBytesObject.ob_shash` member: call :c:func:`PyObject_Hash` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
":c:member:`!PyBytesObject.ob_shash` メンバー：代わりに :c:func:"
"`PyObject_Hash` を呼び出してください。"

msgid "Thread Local Storage (TLS) API:"
msgstr "スレッドローカルストレージ (TLS) API："

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-future.rst:31
msgid ""
":c:func:`PyThread_create_key`: Use :c:func:`PyThread_tss_alloc` instead."
msgstr ""

msgid ":c:func:`PyThread_delete_key`: Use :c:func:`PyThread_tss_free` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`PyThread_delete_key`：代わりに :c:func:`PyThread_tss_free` を使って"
"ください。"

msgid ""
":c:func:`PyThread_set_key_value`: Use :c:func:`PyThread_tss_set` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`PyThread_set_key_value`：代わりに :c:func:`PyThread_tss_set` を使っ"
"てください。"

msgid ""
":c:func:`PyThread_get_key_value`: Use :c:func:`PyThread_tss_get` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`PyThread_get_key_value`：代わりに :c:func:`PyThread_tss_get` を使っ"
"てください。"

#: ../../deprecations/c-api-pending-removal-in-future.rst:39
msgid ""
":c:func:`PyThread_delete_key_value`: Use :c:func:`PyThread_tss_delete` "
"instead."
msgstr ""

msgid ":c:func:`PyThread_ReInitTLS`: Unneeded since Python 3.7."
msgstr ":c:func:`PyThread_ReInitTLS`：Python 3.7 以降では不要です。"
